      "title": "Guide \u2014 Ziggart Krea2 (Qwen3VL-4B) Prompt Director Suite (Modular Pipeline, Head-to-Toe Anatomy Creator & All-in-One Master Director)",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "WORKFLOW 10 : ZIGGART KREA2 (QWEN3VL-4B) PROMPT DIRECTOR SUITE\n1. MODULAR PIPELINE (Nodes 2 -> 3, 4, 5 -> 6) : ZiggartThemeUniverseContext selects a Theme/Universe or Free Crossover + Mood Filter -> ZiggartCharacterUnitBuilder resolves Primary & Secondary Characters with 1:1 Canonical/Compatible/Free Outfit linking & automatic 9-zone Outfit->Anatomy occlusion filtering -> ZiggartSceneStageAtmosphere selects Style, Action, Environment (including ziggart/Env), Lighting & Camera -> ZiggartKrea2PromptAssembler compiles the optimal Qwen3VL-4B prompt.\n2. HEAD-TO-TOE ANATOMY CHARACTER CREATOR (Node 8) : ZiggartAnatomyCharacterCreator builds a character from Head to Toe across 28 anatomical sections (every section can be set to [None] or controlled via View Presets like 'Back View / Seen From Behind').\n3. ALL-IN-ONE MASTER DIRECTOR (Node 7) : ZiggartKrea2MasterPromptDirector combines the entire pipeline in a single node."
      ],
      "color": "#234",
      "bgcolor": "#356"
    },
